       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-POLY-LATTICE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-POLY-LATTICE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-EULER-GROWTH-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LATTICE-RIGIDITY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PERIMETER-MORPH-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LATTICE-LATENCY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LATTICE-SEAL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-LATTICE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PLA-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PLA-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-EULER-AND-RIGIDITY.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MORPH-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PLA-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-EULER-AND-RIGIDITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EULER-GROWTH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LATTICE-RIGIDITY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MORPH-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PERIMETER-MORPH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LATTICE-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PLA-PROOFS.
           IF WS-EULER-GROWTH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LATTICE-RIGIDITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PERIMETER-MORPH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LATTICE-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-LATTICE-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PLA-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PLA-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PLA-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PLA-CODE.
